    "detailed_description": "<h1>Upcoming Games:</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>Join our community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momoka will take care of you and I promise, you won't be disappointed.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She really is a premium one you know ;)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Momoka is here to help you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a bit shy and a bit (okay, a lot) naughty, but that's what makes her so fun to play with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Btw, I haven't seen Momoka eat anything yet.. she never seems to drink water either. I haven't even seen her use the bathroom!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's like some sort of non-human being. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe one day we'll find out more about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, Momoka is a great and kind-hearted maid. I'm lucky to have her around, even though I don't understand how she manages to look so fabulous all the time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But enough about that, you'll have to see it for yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a zoom feature. You can double-click or scroll to zoom in on the pictures in the gallery. (I wanted to mention this in case you want to do some scientific research..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Music Player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a music player in the game, so you can dance while you play.. or you can just turn it off if you don't like it. Everyone has the right to play the game in silence and peace, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let me know what you think! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy gaming ;)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momoka will take care of you and I promise, you won't be disappointed.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She really is a premium one you know ;)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Momoka is here to help you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a bit shy and a bit (okay, a lot) naughty, but that's what makes her so fun to play with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Btw, I haven't seen Momoka eat anything yet.. she never seems to drink water either. I haven't even seen her use the bathroom!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's like some sort of non-human being. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe one day we'll find out more about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, Momoka is a great and kind-hearted maid. I'm lucky to have her around, even though I don't understand how she manages to look so fabulous all the time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But enough about that, you'll have to see it for yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a zoom feature. You can double-click or scroll to zoom in on the pictures in the gallery. (I wanted to mention this in case you want to do some scientific research..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Music Player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a music player in the game, so you can dance while you play.. or you can just turn it off if you don't like it. Everyone has the right to play the game in silence and peace, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let me know what you think! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy gaming ;)</p>",
